      "estimatedOutput": 684,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/guwen-360--bb886ebcb8adc0ab530fc23257ca41b00c3ec439b4041bbe3970a7a4dcf7d8e1.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "guwen-361",
      "category": "古文",
      "title": "围炉夜话·第一三七则",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "王永彬",
      "dynasty": "清",
      "content": "古今有为之士，皆不轻为之士，乡党好事之人，必非晓事之人。",
      "excerptOf": "围炉夜话",
      "excerptNote": "完整选录《围炉夜话》中“第一三七则”一则或一章；非全书。",
