      "estimatedOutput": 708,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/guwen-364--7f338017d380aabad61524be2d3615d49d90bdc26df37a955b6e6ee0631a1f27.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "guwen-365",
      "category": "古文",
      "title": "围炉夜话·第一四一则",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "王永彬",
      "dynasty": "清",
      "content": "成就人才，即是栽培子弟；暴殄天物，自应折磨儿孙。",
      "excerptOf": "围炉夜话",
      "excerptNote": "完整选录《围炉夜话》中“第一四一则”一则或一章；非全书。",
